## 4.1 Request Device List

**• Topic:** device/{mac}/list_request  
**• Direction:** Controller -> Hub

```
{
  "data": "device_list"
}
```

## 4.2 Report Device List

**• Topic:** device/{mac}/list  
**• Direction:** Hub -> Controller

```
{
  "data": [
    {
      "device_name": "Philips TV",
      "device_id": 1
    },
    {
      "device_name": "Apple TV",
      "device_id": 3
    }
  ]
}
```

