  "data": {
    "device_id": 1
  }
}
```

**• Report Device Keys (Hub -> Controller):** device/{mac}/keys_list

```
{
  "data": [
    {
      "key_id": 1,
      "key_name": "Power"
    },
    {
      "key_id": 2,
      "key_name": "OK"
    }
