# 7\. Custom Remote Button Uplink (Automations)

When physical buttons assigned for custom smart home control are pressed on the remote, the Hub broadcasts event notifications in real time. Smart home platforms (like Hubitat) can map this directly into standard 'Button Controller' or 'PushableButton' capabilities to trigger lighting scenes, shades, or complex rules.**• Topic:** {mac}/up  
**• Direction:** Hub -> Controller

```
{
  "key_id": 153,
  "device_id": 1
}
```

